text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_0816D950 {
    "My POKéMON is staggeringly tired...\nI should have brought a POTION..."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_0816D996 {
    "If you cross the sea from here,\nit’ll be a shortcut to OLDALE TOWN.\pFufufu, that’s useful, isn’t it?"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7D55 {
    "Did you feel the tug of our soul-\nsoothing fragrance?"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7D8B {
    "You weren’t led astray by our aroma..."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7DB2 {
    "Aromatherapy is a form of mental\nhealing that works with fragrances."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7DF7 {
    "AMY: I’m AMY.\nAnd this is my little sister LIV.\lWe battle together!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7E3B {
    "AMY: Uh-oh, we lost."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7E50 {
    "AMY: You have to think about all\nkinds of things when you’re battling\lagainst two TRAINERS."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7EAC {
    "AMY: Uh-oh, you have only one\nPOKéMON with you.\lYou can’t battle us like that."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7EFB {
    "LIV: We battle together as one\nteam."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7F20 {
    "LIV: Oh, we lost, big sister..."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7F40 {
    "LIV: We work perfectly together, me\nand my big sister...\pBut we still lost..."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7F8E {
    "LIV: If you want to battle us, you\nhave to have two POKéMON!\lIt’s not fair if you don’t!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B7FE7 {
    "AMY: I’m AMY.\nAnd this is my little sister LIV.\lWe battle together!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B802B {
    "AMY: Aww, boo!\nWe couldn’t win again..."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B8053 {
    "AMY: You have to think about all\nkinds of things when you’re battling\lagainst two TRAINERS."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B80AF {
    "AMY: Uh-oh, you have only one\nPOKéMON with you.\lYou can’t battle us like that."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B80FE {
    "LIV: We battle together as one\nteam."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B8123 {
    "LIV: Awww, we lost again...\nBig sister..."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B814D {
    "LIV: We work perfectly together, me\nand my big sister...\pBut why did we lose again?"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B81A1 {
    "LIV: If you want to battle us, you\nhave to have two POKéMON!\lIt’s not fair if you don’t!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B81FA {
    "Gah! My fishing line’s all snarled up!\nI’m getting frustrated and mean!\lThat’s it! Battle me!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B8258 {
    "Gah! Lost it!\nI’m even more annoyed now!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B8281 {
    "Gah, I’m still boiling mad...\nGrrrrr..."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B82A9 {
    "My POKéMON is delightfully adorable!\nDon’t be shy - I’ll show you!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B82EC {
    "Oh, my gosh!\nMy darling POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B830D {
    "My delightful POKéMON looks darling\neven when it’s fainted!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B8349 {
    "Hi, you! My delightfully adorable\nPOKéMON has become more darling!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B838C {
    "Oh!\nMy darling POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081B83A4 {
    "The more I spend time with it, the\nmore adorable my POKéMON becomes."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081C4449 {
    "PROF. BIRCH: Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\pHave you come to show me how your\nPOKéDEX is coming along?"
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081C449B {
    "Hm? Oh, you haven’t caught enough\nPOKéMON to make it worthwhile."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081C44DC {
    "Hmhm...\pSo, you’ve seen {STR_VAR_1} POKéMON,\nand you’ve caught {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_RutaAzul_G00_M18_Text_081C4B05 {
    "Hmhm...\nOn a nationwide basis...\pYou’ve seen {STR_VAR_1} POKéMON,\nand you’ve caught {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON..."
}
